Moderate,Mid,Forward,Lower_Extremity,Mild
High,Heavy,Center,Lower_Extremity,Moderate
High,Light,Forward,Upper_Extremity,Moderate
Low,Light,Guard,Upper_Extremity,Moderate
Moderate,Heavy,Guard,Lower_Extremity,Severe
Moderate,Mid,Guard,Lower_Extremity,Moderate
Moderate,Mid,Forward,Lower_Extremity,Mild
Low,Heavy,Center,Lower_Extremity,Moderate
High,Heavy,Center,Upper_Extremity,Mild

